id: patch-up
name: Patch-Up
advancement: true
prerequisite: Magical Materialization
tpCost: 4
# "You may also repair their Apparel. Restore a damaged or broken piece of Apparel to have their maximum Break Value" - a
# box in its window; the first worn piece that has lost Break Value, for each one healed.
healPatch: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Healing Hands may also restore a damaged or broken piece of their Apparel to its full Break Value.
text: >
  Patch-Up: You can repair clothing as well as people.
  –Prerequisites: Magical Materialization
  –TP Cost: 4
  –Effect: If you would target a Character with the Healing Hands Magical Ability, you may also repair their Apparel.
  Restore a damaged or broken piece of Apparel to have their maximum Break Value.
